WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.984 --> 00:00:10.968
An updo can expose the fine hairs at the nape that are usually hidden, and they may fall messily over the hanbok collar.

2
00:00:11.304 --> 00:00:15.984
Dark fine hairs stand out even more against an ivory or white jeogori.

3
00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:23.304
We tidy them up as much as possible with wax or spray on the day, but short flyaways can still pop out with movement.

4
00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:29.904
So for a truly flawless back view, either have the nape line cleaned up at a waxing salon 2-3 days before the ceremony,

5
00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:36.408
or apply soap lather at home and neatly trim the lower hairline with an eyebrow razor.

6
00:00:36.744 --> 00:00:44.088
It may seem minor, but a wedding parent's back view draws plenty of attention on the day too, so it needs to look neat and polished.
